- Active task
- Status
- Repository state
- Passing checks
- Blockers

## Completed Most Recently
Short summary.

## Next Action
Exactly one action.

## Acceptance Criteria
Checklist for that action.

## Relevant Files
Only files needed next.

## Verification
Exact commands.

## Resume Protocol
When the user says "continue":
1. Read NEXT.md.
2. Read the active task.
3. Read relevant memory and ADRs.
4. Inspect repository state.
5. Execute the next action.
6. Verify it.
7. Update governance records.

Historical details belong in logs and completed tasks.

